[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 29161.19, "timestamp": "08:06:01", "text": "[音樂] 你只能得兩分。一天只能買兩個。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 29183.27, "timestamp": "08:06:23", "text": "哦，我知道了。她失去我了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 29192.628, "timestamp": "08:06:32", "text": "。  堅持，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 29197.03, "timestamp": "08:06:37", "text": "稍等。  是啊，我得在他打敗我之前殺了他。[音樂][掌聲]"}]